"{{Term/Store|EX Treasure: Garb of Winds||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Treasure: Garb of Winds}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Deya Village Ruins}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TCB}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] is obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding ''[[Misko's EX Journal 2]]'', which is rumored to be in the [[Deya Village Ruins]].<ref>{{Cite|Somewhere in the {{Color BotW|Red|Deya Village Ruins}} is a journal that places the location of this treasure...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading ''Misko's EX Journal 2'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

In ''Misko's EX Journal 2'', there are clues to the locations of six [[Treasure Chest]]s, each containing a priceless relic stolen from [[Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]].<ref>{{Cite|I hid the six priceless relics I stole from Hyrule Castle in treasure chests... I shall write down their locations. -{{Color BotW|Blue|Misko}}|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref> The Journal states the blue garb of the [[Hero of Winds]] can be found at the beginning of the [[Menoat River]].<ref>{{Cite|The blue garb of the hero who controlled the winds and traveled the ocean is {{Color BotW|Red|where the Menoat River was born}}.|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref>

The Treasure Chest can be found at the bottom of [[Cora Lake]] in a large cave opening. Using the [[Cryonis]] and [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]]s, Link can get closer to the Treasure Chest and pull it out of the Lake. Opening it will give him the [[Island Lobster Shirt]], completing the Side Quest.<ref>{{Cite|You found the treasure that was hidden at Cora Lake and obtained the {{Color BotW|Red|Island Lobster Shirt}}!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

